@startuml
!include kartoza.iuml
title Index-score processor family — activity
start
:Read index_score / eplex_score
from item attributes;
:Rescale to 0–5 Likert
(score / 100 × 5, or clamp);
if (Variant?) then (plain / contextual / EPLEX)
  :write_uniform_value_to_grid()
  for every cell in area;
else (with GHSL / with Ookla)
  :Ensure mask dataset available
  (auto-download GHSL / Ookla);
  :Spatial join: cells intersecting
  settlement / connectivity polygons
  get the score;
  :Remaining cells set to 0;
endif
:rasterize_grid_column()
→ <layer_id>_<n>.tif;
:Build combined VRT + QML style;
stop
@enduml
